{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nAJupeauu91795219032.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國網絡安全公司CrowdStrike，據報正洽購同業Zscaler，或成為網絡安全行業史上最大規模的交易之一。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，兩公司正討論潛在合併，並可能很快落實交易，但洽商存在變數，無法保證最終達成交易。Zscaler開發協助企業抵禦網絡威脅的軟件，今年股價已跌了一成三，但消息出現後，股價在延長交易時段一度升兩成六。公司目前市值約317億美元。</p><p></p><p>至於CrowdStrike股價，就在延長交易時段一度跌近一成二。CrowdStrike是業內最大市值企業，約2,349億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:03:52.293216+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":239,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T23:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T16:57:32.581843+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T00:57:15.252484+00:00","content_hash":"cafc3676ea6454ed8944875bd8324c9c24820743be1cc775f884bf74ac3e56dc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:03:52.293216+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}